{"availability":"available","full":"975L/GalleryBundle","name":"GalleryBundle","description":"Symfony bundle providing photo galleries on the c975L core — galleries, categories and photos, with batch upload, automatic thumb/medium/highres derivatives and a public viewer.","category":"Other","language":"PHP","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-13T19:23:28Z","updated":"2026-10-09T16:02:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://bundles.975l.com/demo/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Symfony bundle providing photo galleries on the c975L core — categories and medias (photos and videos from any platform UiBundle declares), with batch upload, automatic thumb/medium/highres derivatives and a public viewer.","Bundle page · Tutorials · Block kinds · Live demo · Demo back-office","Add GalleryBundle on top of c975L/CoreBundle (ConfigBundle + UiBundle, one package) and get a photo gallery — no dependency on SiteBundle, ShopBundle or any other satellite bundle, so it drops into any c975L site that needs one. Multi-size derivatives reuse UiBundle's own VichMultiSizeImageInterface pattern rather than duplicating it."],"features":["A heart under a photo, behind one setting: visitors like it without an account, and the page says how many did (see likes on a photo).","GalleryCategory → GalleryMedia: the category is the top-level unit, a site's galleries being its categories - no container above them.","Bulk upload: pick every file at once from the category they belong to, with a title root, credits and rights-reserved applied to the whole batch, retouched one media at a time afterwards. The same batch is offered on…","Three derivatives generated automatically per uploaded image (thumbnail / medium / highres), all three holding the whole photo, via UiBundle's VichImageResizeListener and the VichMultiSizeImageInterface contract -…","Its own Galerie section in the EasyAdmin sidebar, holding two entries: \"Catégories\", opening the galleries with their media count, where a category's medias are listed under its own edit form and added from the category…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7863841b2098f56fe3708eb2e176c87394e90cbab256bfa6cc3e226be57c818c","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Symfony bundle providing photo galleries on the c975L core — categories and medias (photos and videos from any platform UiBundle declares), with batch upload, automatic thumb/medium/highres derivatives and a public viewer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"A heart under a photo, behind one setting: visitors like it without an account, and the page says how many did (see likes on a photo).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The same move Block::$data and Book::$data make, and for the same reason: what one site needs never costs a schema migration to every app running this bundle.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Every file a media holds travels: the stored one, its thumbnail and high resolution siblings, its self-hosted video, and the original it kept — put back under private/ on import, so an imported gallery can still be re-processed without a re-upload.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No login is asked for and no cookie banner is owed: an authenticated visitor is keyed on their account, anyone else on a token their own browser mints on the click.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"7863841b2098f56fe3708eb2e176c87394e90cbab256bfa6cc3e226be57c818c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T16:02:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/GalleryBundle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","hash":"7863841b2098f56fe3708eb2e176c87394e90cbab256bfa6cc3e226be57c818c","originalBytes":130774,"storedBytes":130774,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["gallery","one","own","category","media","what","site","page","which","nothing","same","back","file","only","url","every","where","medias","rather","screen","see","under","bundle","two","never","print","them","each","uibundle","being","carries","files","photo","public","they","slug","whole","their","index","without","configbundle","lab","there","through","would","block","batch","left","photograph","button","c975l","title","selection","upload","grid","both","row","does","out","three","order","read","still","edit","image","once","over","photographs","categories","form","takes","trash","holds","other","any","galleries","name","written","first","per","stored","before","import","prints","service","thumbnail","above","admin","already","default","prefix","video","blocks","empty","entry","itself","php","reads","whose","credits","field","shows","another","cover","declared","text","theme","visitor","way","automatic","config","none","off","color","description","easyadmin","exactly","instead","it.","language","like","office","path","size","tile","when","app","how","next","pages","resolution","time","keeps","leaves","sits","archive","gallerycategory","lightbox","photos","picke